<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n51127" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἰσοπολῑτ-εία</span></b> , ἡ,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>equality of civic
			rights</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				575
			</span></i>; granted to individuals, <i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				7.4264
			</span></i> (Oropus, <span class="entity">iii B.C.</span>), <i><span class="en">
				5(2).11
			</span></i> (Tegea, <span class="entity">iii B.C.</span>), etc.; or to communities, <i><span class="en">
				<u>SIG</u>
				472.11
			</span></i> (Phigalea, <span class="entity">iii B.C.</span>), <i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				16.26.9
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				D.S.
				15.46
			</span></i>, etc. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> esp.
				<i>reciprocity of such rights</i> (guaranteed by treaty
			between two states), <i><span class="en">
				<u>GDI</u>
				5040
			</span></i> (<span class="entity">Crete</span>), <i><span class="en">
				<u>OGI</u>
				265
			</span></i> (Pergam., <span class="entity">iii B.C.</span>), etc.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Λεβαδεῦσίν ἐστιν ἰ. πρὸς Ἀρκάδας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					2.300b
				</span></i>
			.</div>
